item.description:
Representation of the meaning of a word Definition: meaning
The idea that is represented by a word, phrase, etc. The idea that a person wants to express by using words, signs, etc. The idea that is expressed in a work of writting, art, etc. Commonest linguistic way of thinking of meaning: signifier (symbol) &lt;=&gt; signified (idea or thing)
//denotational semantics//
